'''''Novice in Zenithal Duel''''' is a [[Trailblaze Continuance]] in the chapter [[Finest Duel Under the Pristine Blue (II)]].

==Steps==
# Board the Skysplitter and participate in the Wardance
# Arrive at the Skysplitter's security checkpoint
# Head toward the contestant hall
# Prod around to find out how strong the other contestants are
# Reach the Skysplitter's upper deck
# Head toward the Skysplitter's upper deck
# (Optional) Continue to probe into how strong the other contestants are

