===Board the Skysplitter and participate in the Wardance{{subst:void|<!--202220501-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=continuance|location=Skysplitter|General Huaiyan tasks March 7th and Yunli with boarding the Skysplitter and participating in the Wardance. Apart from striving for victory in the arena, they must also take up the responsibility of defending the arena against potential crises. However, the young swordswoman who will be making her debut can't help but feel anxious at such a prospect...}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
:The Wardance is about to commence<br /><br />Skysplitter
:Skysplitter
:'''March 7th:''' Wow! The Skysplitter's gun salute is really loud! So this is what the Wardance is actually like? I feel like my eardrums are going to burst.
:'''Yunli:''' Well, how could they expect to attract people to come and watch if they didn't make a huge spectacle? March, you haven't forgotten what you came to do, have you?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What... did I come to do?
::'''March 7th:''' Who am I? Where am I? What am I doing here?
::'''Yunli:''' Look around you, do you remember anything?
::'''March 7th:''' Ah, memories of falling from the sky into Taikiyan Stadium have come flooding back to me. We... came to compete, didn't we?
::'''Yunli:''' Great, you've finally gotten your memory back, and I can put down Old Mettle.
::I am here to be the ringmaster on behalf of Master Yanqing!
::'''March 7th:''' As a representative of the Xianzhou Luofu, I will defeat all challengers!
::'''Yunli:''' That's the spirit, sounds like you're all fired up! If you could just keep your legs from shaking so much, it would be more convincing, March.
::I am here to ensure the safety of the Wardance!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I am here to be the ringmaster on behalf of Master Yanqing!
::'''March 7th:''' As a representative of the Xianzhou Luofu, I will defeat all challengers!
::'''Yunli:''' That's the spirit, sounds like you're all fired up! If you could just keep your legs from shaking so much, it would be more convincing, March.
::I am here to ensure the safety of the Wardance!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I am here to ensure the safety of the Wardance!
:'''Yunli:''' That was the mission my grandfather entrusted to me. You just relax and keep guard over the ring.
:'''Yunli:''' As the saying goes, "The disciple takes the toil of their master." Remember, you are here under the identity of a Luofu swordmaster, taking the place of your no-good Master Yanqing as the ringmaster.
:'''March 7th:''' But what am I supposed to do if my opponent for this round is super talented and just wipes the floor with me in seconds? I'm still a beginner in swordplay! I don't know where I got the confidence when I agreed to help General Huaiyan.
:'''Yunli:''' Come on, there's no need to worry about that. If you are defeated, then your opponent shall have to answer to me! Although, if that happens, the honor and the glory of the Xianzhou Luofu shall all be taken by the Zhuming, hahaha...
:'''March 7th:''' Master Yunli, please, I'm about to compete! Can you say something that will give me a little confidence?
:'''Yunli:''' March. Think about the great storms that you Nameless of the Express have weathered along your many journeys. There's no doubt that you have faced far more terrifying enemies than your opponents here today, right? Don't you feel a lot more relaxed looking at it that way?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Master Yunli, I think I should drop out of the contest.
::'''March 7th:''' There's so much pressure, my stomach is really hurting. Maybe... I should just drop out of the contest?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Why don't we call Yanqing back?
::'''March 7th:''' Why don't we call Master Yanqing back? What kind of master would retire at the height of their career and leave their disciple to fight in their place?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Let's get going, then.
::'''March 7th:''' I've trained hard in the art of swordplay over these few days. It's time for me to get in the ring and prove myself. Let's go.
